# Photo assets: ~549 MB, and the only copies in existence.
# Deliberately NOT in git -- they would bloat history permanently and GitHub
# rejects individual files over 100 MB. They are protected instead by
# backup-wcl-assets.ps1, which copies them outside the working tree and,
# with -Dest, offsite. See STATUS.md open task 2.
# website/public/.gitkeep stays tracked so the directory survives a clean clone.
website/public/photos/
website/public/images/
